# Import and export

- API: `web/src/app/api/storeAdmin/[storeId]/<resource>/export/route.ts` and `import/route.ts`.
- Access: `CheckStoreAdminApiAccess(storeId)` from `api/storeAdmin/api_helper.ts`.
- Export: POST returns JSON built with `transformPrismaDataForJson`, with a filename that includes a timestamp.
- Import: validate the JSON shape with Zod; upsert in a transaction; log with `logger`.
- UI: `ImportExportProToolbar` (`(routes)/components/import-export-pro-toolbar.tsx`) on the client list, plus `import-<resource>-dialog.tsx`. It shows only when `useStoreAdminImportExport()` returns `canImportExport`.
- Copy an existing resource (`facility`, `faqCategory`) when adding one.
